{"2672700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lands of Fury", "steam_appid": 2672700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You crash at the base of a Metra mountain that does not let you climb it quietly. Your goal is at the peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run takes you through a mix of <strong>explorable areas, tight paths, and brutal arena fights</strong>.  One moment you’re scouting ahead and choosing your route — the next you’re locked in, surrounded, and forced to fight your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your play-style through the gear you find and the combinations you create — from controlled, precise combat to overwhelming, screen-filling destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside companions you can actively command, turning every encounter into a mix of action and  control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don’t pick a class. You build one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CLIMB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run-based ascent where death sends you back stronger, not back to zero.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp</strong> — set your skill tree, recruit companions, prepare for the climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb</strong> — push through biomes, explore, gather, craft, and fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall</strong> — lose your gear, but keep your meta tokens and unlocked skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return</strong> — invest your progress at camp and climb again, better than before.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/e430decdb23b4afecc556b48faaecb53.poster.avif?t=1787820641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/e430decdb23b4afecc556b48faaecb53.webm?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/e430decdb23b4afecc556b48faaecb53.mp4?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build defines how you fight. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine runes and items to create devastating interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your Fury in battle — then unleash massive rune-based attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain reactions that turn simple attacks into explosive combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TOGETHER. TAKE CONTROL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/0cf85c10f88ca132138f226862c971f5.poster.avif?t=1787820641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/0cf85c10f88ca132138f226862c971f5.webm?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/0cf85c10f88ca132138f226862c971f5.mp4?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You don’t fight alone — and now, you can bring a friend into the fight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, choose <strong>one companion</strong> to join you. Each companion has a distinct role, abilities, and playstyle, giving you a different way to approach combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>shared-screen co-op</strong>, your friend can <strong>take control of that companion</strong> and fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together on the same screen — either side-by-side or online through <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>. You control your main character. Your friend controls your companion. <strong>Two players, one deadly team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate attacks, combine your abilities, control space, and turn your companion's unique strengths into powerful team plays.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take one companion with you on each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate attacks and combine your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play shared-screen co-op with a friend.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Steam Remote Play Together to play online.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You stay in control of your main character.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your friend can take control of your companion.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo and command your companion — or let them fight independently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/1906e2ef1983b2383c60503c0003380f.poster.avif?t=1787820641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/1906e2ef1983b2383c60503c0003380f.webm?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/1906e2ef1983b2383c60503c0003380f.mp4?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the foundation of your build before the climb — then shape it as you fight, earning rewards from each run to unlock new skills (cartridges) and be better prepared for the next ascent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/9ad78da9b10b0d112bab4cc98add083c.poster.avif?t=1787820641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/9ad78da9b10b0d112bab4cc98add083c.webm?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672700/extras/9ad78da9b10b0d112bab4cc98add083c.mp4?t=1787820641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients, and craft powerful items to enhance your combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPLAYABILITY &amp; CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain changes, you evolve.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the forests, caverns and frozen peaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels make every run unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle bandits, ratfolk, undead, dinofolk, golems, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive challenging battles against powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new items, skills and companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in daily runs to earn your place on the leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only fury will carry you to the peak.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You crash at the base of a Metra mountain that does not let you climb 